      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><h2>模型输入</h2><p>输入系数，查看最优解和逐步推导。</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",\"HarmonyOS Sans SC\",\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--fg,#182230);background:var(--card,#fff);border:1px solid var(--line,#dce2eb);border-radius:var(--r-lg,14px);padding:20px;margin-bottom:16px;box-shadow:none}.ds-panel h2{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.65}.ds-panel p{margin:0;color:var(--fg2,#536174);font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}@media(max-width:480px){.ds-panel{padding:16px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-panel{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
